> how to implement hooks

● claude-code-guide(Explain Claude Code hooks)
  ⎿  Done (5 tool uses · 42.1k tokens · 45s)

● Claude Code Hooks

  Hooks are shell commands that execute automatically at specific points during Claude's operation.

  Configuration Location

  Add hooks to your settings file (.claude/settings.json or ~/.claude/settings.json):

  {
    "hooks": {
      "EventName": [
        {
          "matcher": "tool_name_regex",
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "your-script.sh"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }

  Available Events
  ┌──────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┐
  │    Event     │             When it fires             │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ PreToolUse   │ Before a tool executes (can block it) │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ PostToolUse  │ After a tool succeeds                 │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ SessionStart │ When session begins                   │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Stop         │ When Claude finishes responding       │
  ├──────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Notification │ When Claude needs attention           │
  └──────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────┘
  Exit Codes

  - exit 0 - Success, allow action
  - exit 2 - Block the action (stderr shown to Claude)

  Example: Auto-format after edits

  {
    "hooks": {
      "PostToolUse": [
        {
          "matcher": "Edit|Write",
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "npx prettier --write $(jq -r '.tool_input.file_path')"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }

  Example: Block dangerous commands

  {
    "hooks": {
      "PreToolUse": [
        {
          "matcher": "Bash",
          "hooks": [
            {
              "type": "command",
              "command": "jq -r '.tool_input.command' | grep -q 'rm -rf' && exit 2 || exit 0"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }

  Quick Setup

  Type /hooks in Claude Code for an interactive configuration menu.

