  To verify hooks are running:

  Option 1: Enable verbose mode
  Press Ctrl+O during a session to see hook execution details in real-time.

  Option 2: Run with debug flag
  claude --debug

  Option 3: Trigger the hook event
  Hooks only run when their specific event fires. For example:
  - PostToolUse with matcher Edit|Write → runs after I edit/write a file
  - Notification → runs when Claude sends a notification

